WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
Drop a pebble into a still pond.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.430
Ripples race outwards,
crest after crest.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.990
Try to follow one
crest with a stopwatch,

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.730
and it's gone before you
can even press the button.

5
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.890
So how can you measure a speed
you can't even follow by eye?

6
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.050
In this mission, you'll link a
wave's speed to its frequency

7
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.750
and its wavelength in one equation,

8
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.710
and rearrange it to find
whichever one is missing.

9
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.650
Then you'll see how to
measure wave speed in the lab,

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.870
using ripples in water.

11
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.790
Your mission: find out how to
measure the speed of a wave.
